    <briefdescription>
<para>Displays a disassembled binary. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><image type="html" name="AsmView.jpg"></image>
</para><para>Features:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>displaying address, instruction and arguments</para></listitem><listitem><para>functions can be collapesed (double click on function title)</para></listitem><listitem><para>jump targets are shown with red arrows</para></listitem><listitem><para>diff-view on two binaries </para></listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
